# M12 "Yetenek Yolları", flow "skills_rogue" run 2 (PostgreSQL test database only): the level-10 Kargan
# rogue spends its 9 points with the `skilllearn` command (as clicks on "+"; the first asks once):
# Çifte Kesik 3, Sırt Hançeri 2, Gölge Adımı 1 (Pusu tier 3), Zehirli Kesik 3, Sis Bombası 1, puts
# three on the bar, then at the elite Kor Bekçisi (12 m away: it walks into the 10 m reach first) leaps in (Gölge Adımı: SKILL_LEAP glide and the
# shadow trail), throws Sis Bombası (fog cloud and ring, slow on the target frame) and Zehirli Kesik
# (poison: a red-framed icon with seconds on the target frame, smaller tick numbers and wisps).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m12_rog
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+skillsknown+monsters 1800
expect world+level10+skillpoints9+skillmarker
scene expectslot 1 cifte_kesik
scene skilllearn cifte_kesik
waitfor world+modal 60
expecttext messagebox.text geri alınamaz
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+learned1+learnidle 300
scene skilllearn cifte_kesik
waitfor world+learned2+learnidle 300
expect world+unlocked0_2+locked0_3
scene skilllearn sirt_hanceri
waitfor world+learned3+learnidle 300
scene skilllearn sirt_hanceri
waitfor world+learned4+learnidle 300
expect world+unlocked0_3
scene skilllearn golge_adimi
waitfor world+learned5+learnidle 300
scene skilllearn zehirli_kesik
waitfor world+learned6+learnidle 300
scene skilllearn zehirli_kesik
waitfor world+learned7+learnidle 300
scene skilllearn sis_bombasi
waitfor world+learned8+learnidle 300
scene skilllearn zehirli_kesik
waitfor world+learned9+learnidle 300
expect world+skillpoints0+noraise+unlocked1_2+unlocked1_3
scene expectrank golge_adimi 1
scene expectrank zehirli_kesik 3
scene barset 2 golge_adimi
waitfor world+barsets1+baridle 120
scene barset 3 sis_bombasi
waitfor world+barsets2+baridle 120
scene barset 4 zehirli_kesik
waitfor world+barsets3+baridle 120
scene expectslot 2 golge_adimi
scene expectslot 4 zehirli_kesik
key k
waitfor world+skillsopen 60
wait 5
screenshot 01_rogue_tree.png
key k
waitfor world+skillsclosed 30
wait 150
# ---- Leap, fog, poison on a Kor Bekçisi ----
# (the Kargan spawn is on the other side of the village: first north along the plateau, fix1: past the
# north-west thrall pack, the Kor Bekçisi now stands at 210 / 338)
scene walkpath 240 315
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene walktomonster Kor Bekçisi 16
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
expect world+outsidesafe
scene target nearest Kor Bekçisi
wait 2
scene expectslotlook 1 notarget
scene expectslotlook 2 notarget
scene camera side 30 10
# M15: stop outside its 10 m notice first (the slot looks above), then into Gölge Adımı's reach.
scene walktomonster Kor Bekçisi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 1200
key 2
waitfor world+leaps1 120
waitfor world+art_leap_trail 30
wait 8
screenshot 02_leap_trail.png
waitfor world+skilluses1 60
wait 10
expect world+targetinrange
waitfor world+ready_sis_bombasi 120
key 3
waitfor world+targeteffect_slow 120
wait 3
scene expecteffect target slow sis_bombasi
scene expecteffecttip target slow Yavaşlatıldı %30
scene expectart fog_cloud 1
scene expectart ground_ring_fog 1
waitfor world+ready_zehirli_kesik 120
key 4
waitfor world+targeteffect_dot 120
waitfor world+effectticks1 120
waitfor world+art_tick_wisp_poison 120
wait 3
scene expecteffect target dot zehirli_kesik
scene expecteffecttip target dot Zehir: saniyede
hoveron effects.target.1
wait 3
expecttext effects.tooltip Zehirli Kesik
expecttext effects.tooltip Zehir: saniyede
scene camera side 30 11
wait 2
screenshot 03_fog_poison_target_frame.png
scene skilllog
quit
